  "title": "Kennametal Inc. Announces Public Offering of Senior Notes and Cash Tender Offer for Debt Securities",
  "summary": "PITTSBURGH, May 19, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Kennametal Inc. (NYSE: KMT) (the \"Company\") today announced that it has commenced an underwritten public offering of senior notes (the \"Notes Offering\"). The exact amount and terms of the Notes Offering will depend upon market conditions and other factors.",
